$= \sqrt{300p^7} = \sqrt{100p^6 \cdot 3p} = \sqrt{(10p^3)^2 \cdot 3p} = 10p^3\sqrt{3p}$

So, the answer is $\boxed{10p^3\sqrt{3p}}$.The answer is 10p^3\sqrt{3p}

